{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（7日）上午8時19分，警方接報，黃竹坑怡華工業大廈一個單位懷疑傳出爆炸聲，並冒出濃煙。消防到場開喉灌救，大約41分鐘後救熄。事件中無人受傷及毋須疏散，火警原因尚待調查。</p><p>現場消息指，起火單位為11樓一間電子公司，事發時懷疑閉門失火，消防到場迅速救熄後仍有大量濃煙冒出，消防正調查起火原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140231528660865024123879.jpeg/ICNKjE6nKoJ3WTdDcbuNI64QQj-9E51eWZhMVnyYTFY\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140231526320312320609573.jpeg/WCYSDQ8h6Xsnv9pNSeNByIN5fKFEpn_RpaznhoCs54Y\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140231524264972288923016.jpeg/_27PxZhrA5mpEWULeuX7z6mQIIgkpFbmR6HseWKh7Hk\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"懷疑是涉事單位。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140231521542737920952834.jpeg/IW1-kPdoIbsNn2pnJ9e_LMmWX0p_By988lp_1ddaf9U\"/><figcaption>懷疑是涉事單位。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防開喉灌救。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260607/1140231519105716224762093.jpeg/p714JBPULx8B_qG3nEU9IS1E6V9GD0Jbd86I6VLOiOk\"/><figcaption>消防開喉灌救。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-07T02:23:12.651786+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}